This product is a rewrite in Go of BlogCFC, a ColdFusion blog by
Raymond Camden (https://github.com/teamcfadvance/BlogCFC5, version
5.9.8; the reference copy used for this rewrite is the fork at
https://github.com/4scottt/BlogCFC5, branch oldbox/5.9.8).

BlogCFC is Copyright 2006-2012 Raymond Camden and contributors and is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (its install/readme.md
carries the license statement).

The following parts of BlogCFC are reproduced or adapted here under
that license, with attribution:

  - the user-facing strings in its resource bundles
    (client/includes/main_en_US.properties and the de_* bundles)
  - the trackback/comment spam term list shipped with its default
    settings
  - the semantics of its database schema, permalink grammar, settings
    keys and RSS output

Nothing from the Arclite theme (GPL) is copied; the look is recreated
with original CSS.
